  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the Pork Jowl into Minced
  - Chop the Onion into Minced
  - Chop Ginger into slice
  - Chop Garlic into slice
  - Chop Chil into slice
  - Turn on the Stove to high heat
  - Put the pan in the Stove
  - Add Pork jowl
  - Saute it until brown
  - Add 2 tbsp of Cooking Oil
  - Add chop Onion
  - Saute until translucent
  - Add Chop Ginger
  - Add Chop Chili
  - Add Chiken Liver
  - Mix it using the spatula
  - 'Add 3 tbsp of Soy '
  - Add 1/2 tsp of peppercorn
  - Add 1/4 tps of peppercorn
  - Add Calamansi Juice
  - Mix using spatula
